"Later, the Heirs of Gemore swear their oath on the Gemore Seal."
"Years later, a new, farther wall of ancient stone with metal pillars and towers rings Gemore."
"Years later, the whole town of Azamar moves to Gemore with Hibril."
"Years later, Azamar's people build glass-faced homes into Gemore's mountainside."
"Years later, steam-engine carriages haul metal plates through Gemore's streets."
"Years later, a regular trade route crosses the mountains between Gemore and Giantsrest."
"Years later, Stella's winds shorten the trip from the coast to Gemore to a few hours."
